# 基准路线：界面重的一段——营地里开总面板、把页签来回翻几遍、开关暂停页。mark 切段：panels
# Benchmark route: a UI-heavy stretch -- in the camp, open the combined panel, flip through the tabs a few times, open and close the pause page. Segments cut by mark: panels
name ui_heavy
save warlock
env DM_GAME_SEED=305419896
timeout 180

enter_game
sleep 2
mark panels
press PLUS
sleep 0.5
press R
sleep 0.5
press R
sleep 0.5
press R
sleep 0.5
press R
sleep 0.5
press L
sleep 0.5
press L
sleep 0.5
press L
sleep 0.5
press L
sleep 0.5
press B
sleep 0.5
open_pause
sleep 0.5
close_pause
sleep 0.5
mark end
quit
check no_red
